  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="960" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Geospatial and parcel intelligence</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1100" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">Approvals in Nigeria are place-based decisions. The platform links parcel identity, legal context, geofenced workflow signals, and map-based evidence to one operating record.</text>
